msgstr "Ksystraycmd"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:190
msgid "&Hide"
msgstr "Steek weg"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:190
msgid "&Restore"
msgstr "Herstel"

#: ksystraycmd.cpp:191
msgid "&Undock"
msgstr "Ontdok"

#: main.cpp:24
#, fuzzy
msgid "Command to execute"
msgstr "Opdrag na uitvoer."

#: main.cpp:26
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken - not recommended."
msgstr ""
"'n gewone uitdrukking ooreenstemmende die venster titel.\n"
"As jy doen nie spesifiseer een, dan word die baie eerste venster\n"
"na verskyn sal wees geneem. nie aanbeveel!"

#: main.cpp:29
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The window id of the target window\n"
"Specifies the id of the window to use. If the id starts with 0x\n"
"it is assumed to be in hex."
msgstr ""
"Die venster id van Die teiken venster.\n"
"Spesifiseer Die id van Die venster na gebruik. As Die id beginne met 0x\n"
"dit is aangeneem na wees in hex."

#: main.cpp:32
msgid "Hide the window to the tray on startup"
msgstr "Steek weg die venster na die laai op opstart"

#: main.cpp:33
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Wait until we are told to show the window before\n"
"executing the command"
msgstr ""
"Wag totdat ons is gesê na vertoon die venster voor\n"
"uitvoer van die opdrag"

#: main.cpp:35
msgid "Sets the initial tooltip for the tray icon"
msgstr "Verstel die aanvanklike gereedskap punt vir die laai ikoon"

#: main.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Keep the tray icon even if the client exits. This option\n"
"has no effect unless startonshow is specified."
msgstr ""
"Hou die laai ikoon al as die kliënt uitgaan. Hierdie opsie\n"
"het nee effek tensy startonshow is gespesifiseer."

#: main.cpp:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Quit the client when we are told to hide the window.\n"
"This has no effect unless startonshow is specified and implies keeprunning."
msgstr ""
"Verlaat die kliënt wanneer ons is gesê na steek weg die venster\n"
"het nee effek tensy startonshow is gespesifiseer en impliseer keeprunning."

#: main.cpp:49
#, fuzzy
msgid "Allows any application to be kept in the system tray"
msgstr "Laat toe enige aansoek na wees gehou in die stelsel laai."

#: main.cpp:89
msgid "No command or window specified"
msgstr "Nee opdrag of venster gespesifiseer"

